{"title":"赤脚医生好","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1976,"month":6,"day":18}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我和葵花一齐长　根深叶茂靠阳光"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痛击右倾翻案风　深入批邓打先锋"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"根根草药凝深情　合作医疗为人民"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"阳光灿烂春满园　喜看春苗长成材"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背起药箱扛起锄"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤脚永走革命路"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(本版照片均为本报通讯　员、本报记者摄)"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心中有个白求恩　银针先扎自己身"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"预防工作做在前　赤脚医生众人赞"}],"comments":[],"origin":"本报","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}